# The gems actionpack's tests load, at the versions the rails repository's
# own Gemfile allows: actionview, activemodel, activesupport and what they
# load, rails-dom-testing and rails-html-sanitizer from their checkouts,
# capybara, selenium-webdriver and webrick for the system test helpers, and
# launchy, dalli, rack-cache and msgpack for the tests that load them. The
# memcached session store tests reach a server on its default port, which
# the suite does not start.
